privacy=heading('Your information, handled simply','A little clarity<br><em>about your privacy.</em>','How this website and BG. Event Management handle personal information.')+prose(
 '<h2>Who we are</h2><p>BG. Event Management, Thirumangalam, Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India. You can reach us at '+CONTACT_LINE+'.</p>',
 '<h2>What this website collects</h2><p>This website has no enquiry form, user accounts, cookies, advertising or analytics trackers, and it does not store anything in your browser. We do not collect or store personal data through the site itself.</p>',
 '<h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The site is delivered by a hosting provider (Vercel Inc.). Like most web hosts, it may automatically process technical data such as IP address, browser type, pages requested and timestamps to deliver the site, keep it secure and prevent abuse. We do not use this data to identify visitors.</p>',
 '<h2>When you contact us</h2><p>If you choose “Chat on WhatsApp”, WhatsApp opens with a short prefilled message and anything you then send is shared with us through WhatsApp, which is operated by Meta and has its own privacy terms. If you choose “Call” or email us, your phone provider or email service handles that communication. Messages, call details and any information you share with us are then held by BG. Event Management.</p>',
 '<h2>How we use it and how long we keep it</h2><p>We use what you share only to respond to you, discuss your occasion, prepare a quotation and, if you go ahead, plan and deliver your event. We keep enquiry details for as long as needed for these purposes and for ordinary business records, and delete them when no longer needed. Please share only what is needed and avoid sensitive personal information.</p>',
 '<h2>Who we share it with</h2><p>We do not sell your information. We share details only with the suppliers and venues needed to deliver an event you have asked us to plan, or where the law requires it. Some services we rely on (such as WhatsApp and our hosting provider) may process data outside India.</p>',
 '<h2>Your choices and rights</h2><p>You may ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or withdraw your consent to us using it. We handle personal information in line with applicable Indian law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, as it applies to us. To make a request or raise a concern, contact '+CONTACT_LINE+'. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may approach the relevant authority under Indian law.</p>',
 '<h2>Photographs and reviews</h2><p>Our portfolio shows photographs from events we have managed, and our reviews page shows short excerpts of client feedback. If you appear in a photograph or are quoted and would like it changed or removed, tell us and we will act on your request promptly.</p>',
 '<h2>External links</h2><p>Instagram, YouTube, Google Maps and WhatsApp open their own services, which handle information under their own privacy policies.</p>',
 '<h2>Children</h2><p>This website is intended for adults planning events and does not knowingly collect information from children.</p>',
 '<h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>We may update this notice from time to time. The date below shows when it last changed.</p><p class="small">Last updated '+UPDATED+'.</p>')
page('privacy','Privacy notice',privacy,'How BG. Event Management handles personal information. This website uses no cookies, trackers or forms.')

