access=heading('A site for everyone','Accessibility<br><em>statement.</em>','We want everyone planning an occasion to be able to use this website.')+prose(
 '<h2>Our aim</h2><p>BG. Event Management aims for this website to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>',
 '<h2>What we have done</h2><ul class="plain-list single"><li>Every page works with a keyboard, has a “Skip to content” link and shows a clear focus outline.</li><li>Text and controls meet colour-contrast guidelines, and the layout adapts to phones, tablets and desktops and to zoomed or enlarged text.</li><li>Photographs have text descriptions, and links and buttons describe where they lead.</li><li>Motion is limited and is switched off if your device is set to reduce motion.</li><li>We do not use cookies, pop-ups, timed content or forms that must be completed.</li></ul>',
 '<h2>How this was checked</h2><p>We tested the site with automated accessibility tools (Lighthouse and axe-core) and keyboard navigation across phone, tablet and desktop screen sizes on '+UPDATED+'. The site has not yet been independently audited or tested with a range of screen readers, so some issues may remain.</p>',
 '<h2>Known limitations</h2><p>Some portfolio photographs are supplied by clients or event teams and carry short descriptions rather than full detail.</p>',
 '<h2>Tell us about a problem</h2><p>If you have difficulty using any part of this website, or need information in another format, contact '+CONTACT_LINE+'. You can also message us on <a href="'+WA_URL+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>. We will try to help or fix the issue as soon as we can.</p><p class="small">Last updated '+UPDATED+'.</p>')
page('accessibility','Accessibility statement',access,'Accessibility statement for the BG. Event Management website.')

